# ============================================================================
# BOMLLM — Ollama Modelfile (SANITIZED EXAMPLE, 709-L pin 2026-09-16)
# Build:   ollama create qwen38-uni -f configs/ollama-modelfile.example
# Verify:  ollama show qwen38-uni --modelfile
#
# Design notes:
#  * ONE manifest, ONE production alias (2026-09-16 cutover: the old
#    chat/think/code/deep/fast alias fan-out was retired; behavior now
#    lives ONLY on the LiteLLM route, aliases were dead weight).
#  * Weights are NOT redistributed. Pull the base from the original
#    author's Hugging Face repo and point FROM at your local tag.
#  * The SYSTEM floor below is a PLACEHOLDER persona. The validated Thai
#    system prompt (Config G) ships in configs/sampling-recipe.yaml —
#    apply it per-route, not baked in, so raw callers and WebUI users can
#    each get the right persona.
#  * RENDERER/PARSER below are the Thai-script rendering keys our
#    production ollama build honors (verified on stock 0.34.1 — the
#    model manifest carries them through `ollama show --modelfile`).
#    If your build errors on unknown keys, delete those two lines.
# ============================================================================

# Base weights: a 27B-class Qwen fine-tune (TURBO-Fable series by DavidAU),
# MLX nvfp4 quant, then the 709-L tune of that series. Replace with the
# tag YOU pulled.
#   Example: ollama pull hf.co/<author>/<repo>:<tag>   then FROM that tag.
FROM turbo-fable-nvfp4   # CHANGE_ME — your local tag for the 27B MLX weights

# Thai script rendering/parser binding (production 709-L Modelfile verbatim).
RENDERER qwen3.8
PARSER qwen3.5

# Context floor for every caller.
# [PROD LESSON] post-swap we lost the Modelfile floor and raw callers
# silently dropped to num_ctx 8192. Set it here; routes can raise it.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Production pin (709-L, promoted 2026-09-16 after the Arm B paired eval,
# +0.225 publishable-first-pass rate vs the 735 incumbent). Route-level
# params in litellm.yaml still win per-request; these are the safe
# defaults for raw callers that bypass the proxy.
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER presence_penalty 0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

# Minimal safety floor persona (REPLACE with your own; the full validated
# Thai recipe with few-shots is in configs/sampling-recipe.yaml).
SYSTEM """
You are a helpful assistant. Answer in the language of the user's most
recent message unless instructed otherwise. Never emit Chinese characters
unless the user asks about Chinese. Be concise; admit uncertainty.
"""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rollback pattern (2026-09-16 cutover): keep the previous incumbent as a
#   -bak alias so promotion is reversible in seconds:
#     ollama cp qwen38-uni qwen38-uni-735-bak   # BEFORE promoting
#     ollama cp qwen38-709l qwen38-uni          # promote
#     ollama cp qwen38-uni-735-bak qwen38-uni   # rollback, if needed
# Differentiate behavior in litellm.yaml routes (temperature, num_predict,
# think on/off) — NOT in extra Modelfiles or aliases.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
